---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectIndex from '../components/ProjectIndex.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
import { selectedProjects } from '../data/projects';
---

<BaseLayout title="Theresia Saumu | Applied AI & ML Engineer" description="Portfolio of Theresia Saumu, an Applied AI and Machine Learning engineer building useful systems with AI, ML, data, analytics, and automation.">

  <section class="hero shell">
    <div>
      <h1>I build <span class="hero-accent">systems</span> that connect data, models, and interfaces into <span class="hero-accent">useful solutions</span>.</h1>

      <ul class="hero-roles" role="list" aria-label="Current roles">
        <li class="hero-role">Applied AI &amp; Machine Learning Engineer</li>
        <li class="hero-role">ML Engineer Intern @ FlyRank AI</li>
        <li class="hero-role">Data Science Intern @ AnalystLab Africa</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p>I start with the problem, not the technology. I want to understand what needs to happen, what would make the solution useful, and what needs to be true for it to work. Then I choose the technical approach and build from there. The clearest example is my Agentic BI Builder, where I built the system end to end around the actual work involved in starting a BI project.</p>
        <p>I’m now looking to apply that skill to real problems at early-stage companies. I want to work on problems that are still being figured out, build the system around what actually needs to happen, and iterate until it is actually useful.</p>
      </div>

      <a class="text-link" href="/projects">View my work →</a>
    </div>
    <figure class="hero-portrait">
      <img src="/images/theresia-portrait.jpeg" alt="Theresia Saumu smiling against a green background." width="1209" height="1300" />
      <figcaption>Theresia Saumu</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </section>

  <section class="selected-work shell" aria-labelledby="selected-work-title">
    <h2 id="selected-work-title">Selected work</h2>
    <ProjectIndex projects={selectedProjects} featured />
  </section>

  <div class="cta-wrap shell">
    <CTA title="Give me one problem you'd like solved by next week." body="Give me one scoped problem. I'll spend a week building a solution and you can decide if you want me on the team." />
  </div>
</BaseLayout>